# MedSync Platform - Product Changelog

**Month:** January 2026

## New Features

- **Enhanced Search:** Improved patient search with support for partial name matching.
- **Bulk Actions:** Added the ability to perform bulk actions on multiple patients at once.

## Bug Fixes

- Fixed an issue where patient search failed with special characters (MS-1234).
- Resolved a bug that caused notifications to be delayed by up to 5 minutes.

## Performance Improvements

- Optimized database queries, resulting in a 20% improvement in page load times.
